g style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; color: inherit;\">Calendly Event Sync:</strong></p><ul class=\"ql-rendered-list-container\" data-is-root=\"true\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: auto; padding: 1px 0px 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; list-style: none; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out, line-height 0.2s ease-out, opacity 0.1s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86); width: 720px; max-width: 720px; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list\" data-block-id=\"block-ae9de2a8-ab7b-4fc8-ad22-7c9b42a49c8f\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0.25em 10px 0.25em 1.75em; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; list-style-type: none; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; counter-increment: none !important;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\">Events from Calendly will be synced as long as your integration is active and you have selected a calendar.</p></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list\" data-block-id=\"block-14c4f82d-0300-479e-8cbf-a84ba6a533dc\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0.25em 10px 0.25em 1.75em; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; list-style-type: none; counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0; counter-increment: none !important;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; counter-reset: list-0 0;\">When you connect your Calendly account, only events created after setting up the connection will be synced into our system. Remember, syncing will occur only for the calendars you've selected.</p></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list\" data-block-id=\"block-7367ec75-47e6-4716-b512-c629d28e7fd0\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0.25em 10px 0.25em 1.75em; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning