: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Enter Domain</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- Input the domain you want to transfer.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Eligibility Check</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- Confirm the domain qualifies for transfer.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; list-style-type: decimal; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.68; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Review DNS Records</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;- Upload or scan DNS settings for continuity.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0