start=\"1413\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1417\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What You Should Do Next</strong></h3><p data-end=\"1769\" data-start=\"1447\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\u2705 <strong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1449\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Switch to Utility Templates</strong> \u2013 Update important marketing messages to utility templates to avoid disruptions.<br data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1564\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\u2705 <strong data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1566\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Use Click-to-WhatsApp Ads</strong> \u2013 Engage customers by driving them to direct WhatsApp conversations.<br data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1667\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\u2705 <strong data-end=\"1708\" data-start=\"1669\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Maximize the 24-Hour Service Window</strong> \u2013 Take advantage of real-time messaging to stay connected.</p><h3 data-end=\"1802\" data-start=\"1771\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-end=\"1800\" data-start=\"1775\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Key Dates to Remember</strong></h3><p data-end=\"1930\" data-start=\"1803\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">? <strong data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1806\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Pause Start Date:</strong> April 1, 20